# Words that must never appear in this repo, one per line.
# Copy this file to `.private-terms` (gitignored) and replace these with YOUR OWN:
# client names, brand names, internal project names, vendors, anything private.
#
# Matched case-insensitively on whole words across every .mjs, .md and .json file.
# The list stays on your machine. It is deliberately NOT in the source, because a
# checker that hard-codes the names it protects publishes them the moment you share it.
acme-corp
northwind
your-client-name
your-internal-project
